{"id":"vod_bf_3122","vodId":"3122","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"碧蓝之海","name_cn":"碧蓝之海","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-4/7c019cfa14edb6680bf370757b98d914.jpg"},"summary":"高中毕业之后，北原伊织（内田雄马 配音）顺利的进入了大学，即将展开崭新的大学生活。为了上学，北原来到了一座坐落在海边的城市里，和内陆城市完全不同的海洋气候使得北原对未来的生活充满了憧憬和希冀，同时也使他开始接触潜水这项有趣的运动。　　个性活泼开朗略微有些强势的古手川千纱（安济知佳 配音）、温柔体贴实际上对妹妹千沙充满了强烈的占有欲的古手川奈华（内田真礼 配音）、时常顶撞北原但其实对哥哥充满了兴趣的傲娇少女北原栞，在这里，北原很快就结识到了一帮志同道合的好友们。加入了潜水部的北原，又会在这项运动中找到怎样的意义呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:52:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/bilanzhihai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/bilanzhihai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/bilanzhihai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bilanzhihai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/bilanzhihai/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:42:13.646Z"}